---
// 联系方式 + 留言表单（表单提交到 /api/contact，由 Sakura Backend 提供）
---
<section class="section" id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="section-label reveal">联系方式</p>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">与我联系</h2>
    <div class="section-divider reveal"></div>

    <div class="contact-bento">
      <!-- 左侧：直达通道卡片列 -->
      <div class="contact-channels reveal">
        <p class="contact-Lead">
          目前处于 <strong>开放工作机会（AI / 数据工程 / 自动化研发）</strong> 状态。无论是技术交流、工作机会还是项目合作，都欢迎随时发起对话。
        </p>
        <div class="contact-grid-vertical">
          <a href="https://github.com/qtXingYue" class="contact-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">
            <div class="contact-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/></svg></div>
            <div><p class="contact-label">GITHUB REPOSITORY</p><p class="contact-value">github.com/qtXingYue ↗</p></div>
          </a>
          <a href="https://qtxingyue.me" class="contact-item" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:none;">
            <div class="contact-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3a13.5 13.5 0 0 1 0 18M12 3a13.5 13.5 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div>
            <div><p class="contact-label">ONLINE DOMAIN</p><p class="contact-value">qtxingyue.me ↗</p></div>
          </a>
          <div class="contact-item">
            <div class="contact-icon"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12S4 16 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div>
            <div><p class="contact-label">BASE LOCATION</p><p class="contact-value">中国 · 深圳 (Shenzhen)</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右侧：高定毛玻璃留言终端卡 -->
      <div class="contact-form-wrap contact-form-card reveal">
        <div class="contact-card-head">
          <h3 class="contact-card-title">发送即时消息</h3>
          <span class="contact-card-code">DIRECT MESSAGE // API</span>
        </div>
        <form class="contact-form" id="contactForm" onsubmit="return handleContactSubmit(event)">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="contactName">姓名</label>
              <input id="contactName" name="name" placeholder="你的姓名 / 称呼" required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="contactEmail">邮箱</label>
              <input id="contactEmail" name="email" type="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="contactMessage">消息内容</label>
            <textarea id="contactMessage" name="message" placeholder="聊聊项目合作、岗位机会或技术想法..." rows="4" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-form-footer">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">发送消息 →</button>
            <p class="form-msg" id="formMsg"></p>
          </div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
